" model in a window or in a notebook, the plotting backend ``\"webgl\"`` for "
"a fast, lightweight view in the web browser (also to share a model as a HTML"
" file) and the plotting backend ``\"matplotlib\"`` for figures of "
"publications, screenshots without a display (e.g. on a server or in a CI-"
"pipeline) or a model together with other plots in one figure."
