"This function is further added as the ``material`` argument of "
":class:`~felupe.MaterialStrain`. If the material makes use of state "
"variables, the shapes of these internal state variables must be provided. By"
" default, the small-strain framework is used. Optionally, this may be "
"changed to a Total-Lagrange, a co-rotational or a Seth-Hill strain "
"framework. The Seth-Hill framework requires the strain exponent :math:`m` of"
" the Seth-Hill strain tensors, e.g. ``framework=\"seth-hill\", "
"strain_exponent=0`` for the logarithmic strain tensor."
